:: Connudatus Street Flash
<<if $xchange.blackmail.activeQuest?.id is 12>><<set $xchange.blackmail.activeQuest.flashedPeople++>><<blackmail-timepassed>><</if>>
<<effects>><<generate1>>

You spend some time looking around for a suitable target, until you spot a small pause in the flow of people, as a <<person1>><<person>> approaches.
<br><br>

With your pulse racing, you take a step in front of <<him>> and
<<if $worn.lower.skirt is 1>>
    raise your skirt to reveal your <<undies>>.
<<elseif $player.gender_appearance is "f">>
    lower your top enough to give a glimpse of your <<undertop>>.
<<else>>
    lower your pants to reveal your <<undies>>.
<</if>>
<br><br>

With the <<persons>> mouth agape, you run off into the distance in an attempt to lose yourself in the crowd.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Connudatus Street]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Street Mailbox Steal
<<if !$mailboxSteal or typeof $mailboxSteal isnot "object">>
	<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
	You step away from the mailboxes.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Domus Street]]>><<unset $mailboxSteal>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set _street to $mailboxSteal.street>>
	<<set _streetName to $mailboxSteal.streetName>>
	<<set _returnPassage to $mailboxSteal.returnPassage>>
	<<set _place to $mailboxSteal.place>>
	<<set _mailboxDay to Math.max(0, Time.days - (Time.hour lt 6 ? 1 : 0))>>
	<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<set $bus to _street>><<effects>>
	<<if !$daily.mailboxSteal or typeof $daily.mailboxSteal isnot "object" or Array.isArray($daily.mailboxSteal)>>
		<<set $daily.mailboxSteal to {}>>
	<</if>>
	<<if $daily.mailboxSteal[_street]>>
		You already emptied a mailbox here today.
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Next|_returnPassage]]>><<unset $mailboxSteal>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<set $daily.mailboxSteal[_street] to true>>
		<<if !$daily.mailboxStealStreak>>
			<<if $mailboxStealLastDay is _mailboxDay - 1>>
				<<set $mailboxStealStreak to ($mailboxStealStreak or 0) + 1>>
			<<elseif $mailboxStealLastDay is _mailboxDay>>
				<<set $mailboxStealStreak to Math.max($mailboxStealStreak or 0, 1)>>
			<<else>>
				<<set $mailboxStealStreak to 1>>
			<</if>>
			<<set $mailboxStealLastDay to _mailboxDay>>
			<<set $daily.mailboxStealStreak to true>>
			<<if $mailboxStealStreak gte 30>>
				<<earnFeat "Porch Pirates">>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
		<<set _moneyGain to random($mailboxSteal.min, $mailboxSteal.max) * 100>>
		You wait for a quiet moment, then slip close to a mailbox on _streetName, near _place. Inside is an envelope containing <<printmoney _moneyGain>>.
		<<money _moneyGain "thievery">>
		<br><br>
		<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 800>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
		<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
			<<skulduggeryuse 800 "target" 2>>
			You tuck it away and leave before anyone notices.
			<br><br>
			<<link [[Next|_returnPassage]]>><<unset $mailboxSteal>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
		<<else>>
			<<skulduggeryuse 800 "target" 2>>
            <<generatePolice 1>><<generatePolice 2>><<generates3>>
                A door opens behind you. A <<person3>><<person>> spots the open mailbox, then your hands.
                "Thief!" <<he>> shouts.
                <br><br>
                The word cracks through the street that a few heads turn. Somewhere nearby, a police officer pauses mid-step, eyes snapping toward the commotion.
                Then <<person1>><<he>> sees you, the mailbox, and the panic spreading across the <<person3>><<persons>> face.
                <br><br>
                "Hey! Stop right there!" the officer barks.
                Another officer looks over from across the road, one hand already reaching for <<person2>><<his>> radio.
                <br><br>
                Within seconds, both of them are moving toward you, first at a fast walk, then breaking into a run.
			<<if currentSkillValue('athletics') gte 600>>
				You sprint away, <span class="green">fast enough to lose <<him>></span> around the corner.<<athletics 1>><<gathletics>><<stress 6>><<tiredness 6>><<ggstress>><<gtiredness>>
				<br><br>
				<<link [[Next|_returnPassage]]>><<unset $mailboxSteal>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
			<<else>>
				You run, but <span class="red">can't keep enough distance.</span> <<He>> catches up and grabs you as you trip.
				<br><br>
				<<link [[Next|Street Police Full]]>><<set $phase to 0>><</link>>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>